# Plan 22's hand-flown battle: the console's pages (combat-parity.sh at Lieutenant).
# The phaser banks and salvoes, the spread, targets, fire, the CONN page's power, shields and lock, the Tactics
# page's maneuvers, Engage and its arrows, and Delegate on and off.
at 0 steer 0 0 0 1
at 5 page phasers
at 10 set banks none
at 20 set bank 0 100
at 30 set bank 3 50
at 40 fire phasers
at 60 page torpedoes
at 70 set salvo 0 3
at 80 set spread 4
at 90 fire torpedoes
at 120 target next
at 130 target prev
at 140 target 2
at 150 fire both
at 170 page conn
at 180 set power 2
at 200 set shields off
at 230 set shields on
at 260 set lock on
at 300 set power 4
at 330 page tactics
at 340 maneuver 0
at 350 maneuver 1
at 360 engage
at 420 engage
at 430 scroll down
at 440 scroll up
at 450 delegate on
at 600 delegate off
at 620 page damage
at 640 page sensors
at 660 page conn
at 680 set banks all
at 690 fire both
